{"id":"n70865-1-9","stage":0,"title":"육교 · 天桥","scene":"交通与出行","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70865-1-9-1","ko":"횡단보도가 멀리 있다.","zh":"人行横道在很远的地方。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"횡단보도가","meaning":"人行横道，斑马线","explanation":"횡단보도：人行横道，斑马线；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"횡단보도","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73246","senseId":"1","lemma":"횡단보도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"횡단보도가","audio":"/audio/85926705b5ba9deeaab3.mp3"}},{"text":"멀리","meaning":"很远","explanation":"멀리：距离远；这里指人行横道的位置很远。","readings":[{"term":"멀리","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54965","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멀리","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3"}},{"text":"있다.","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다：位于；-다 是非敬语陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1be9bc555fce2a50","term":"횡단보도","zh":"人行横道，斑马线","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3","entryId":"73246","definition":"车道上标示出来的供行人横向穿过的路。","pronunciation":["횡단보도","휑단보도"]},{"id":"f62a38710e04901c","term":"멀리","zh":"远","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3","entryId":"54965","definition":"空间距离很远；这里说人行横道很远。","pronunciation":["멀ː리"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"位于、在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"某物位于某处；这里指人行横道的位置。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a8ee6d4038030bd7ae3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70865-1-9-2","ko":"약속 시간에 늦었으니까 육교로 길을 건너자.","zh":"因为已经迟到了，我们走天桥过马路吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"약속","meaning":"约定的","explanation":"약속：约好的见面或事项；修饰后面的 시간。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"s