9eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"ae4eff8714e3e6f2","term":"육교","zh":"人行天桥","audio":"/audio/ae4eff8714e3e6f28c0d.mp3","entryId":"70865","definition":"跨过道路供行人通行的桥。","pronunciation":["육꾜"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"道路、马路","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"供人和车辆通行的道路；这里指要跨过的马路。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"07eea3489942d9d9","term":"건너다","zh":"过，跨过，渡过","audio":"/audio/07eea3489942d9d94543.mp3","entryId":"53853","definition":"越过或经过某物，移动到对面。","pronunciation":["건ː너다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c4532f7c236370360c55.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70865","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":29,"sequenceScore":1.2667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["人行横道在很远的地方。","因为已经迟到了，我们走天桥过马路吧。","咖啡太浓了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["人行横道在很远的地方。","因为已经迟到了，我们走天桥过马路吧。","咖啡太浓了。"],"answer":1}]}
